OL,3,GNEWSAFilm archive chronicling region
OL,4,Areceives #300,000
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore than #300,000 has been put towards
OL,7,Fpreserving a film collection that
OL,8,Fdocuments more than 130 years of life
OL,9,Facross the East of England.
OL,11,FThe National Lottery has funded a
OL,12,Fproject worth #374,697 to help the
OL,13,FUniversity of East Anglia (UEA) and the
OL,14,FEast Anglian Film Archive (EAFA)
OL,15,Fprepare to move the collection to a new
OL,16,Fbuilding on the university's campus.
OL,18,FThe EAFA is the UK's first regional
OL,19,Ffilm archive and has documented the
OL,20,Farea's social and cultural history.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
