OL,4,Areceives #300,000
OL,5,
OL,6,FProf Catherine Richardson, the pro
OL,7,Fvice-chancellor of arts and humanities
OL,8,Fat UEA, said the funding enabled the
OL,9,Fcollection to be available to wider
OL,10,Faudiences, adding: "There are some real
OL,11,Fhidden gems in there."
